// STM_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2694769041" "They abused us.  They'll abuse you, too!"
// STM_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P895731744" "Don't trust The Family!"
// STM_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P758051933" "The Family are slave-drivers!"

// STM_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_HECKLER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3003546950" "You're all evil!"
// STM_ALLHOODS_LEDGE_HECKLER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4207680243" "There is nothing redeemable about any of you!"

// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3256176240" "I am absolutely disgusted with conditions here.  We have been utterly abused."
// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2690079113" "I don't think a petition is going to cover it, to be honest."
// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2120086691" "Picket signs and marches are all well and good, but at some point you need to take ACTION."
// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1962391555" "This entire place is a cesspool."

// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_A_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1563333801" "The oppression ends NOW!"
// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_A_ALERT_TEXT :
"P830291758" "If I'm going down, I'm taking a few with me!"
// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_A_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2918352638" "The time is NOW to make a statement!"

// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CELLPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4219969096" "Oh, it's bad here.  We're outnumbered and outpowered.  How are thing with you?"
// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CELLPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P420525143" "It's pretty tense here.  People are getting twitchy."
// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CELLPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2426935319" "I'm thinking it can only end badly."

// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CELLPHONE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P847944131" "Gotta go!  Things are getting complicated!"
// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CELLPHONE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1582012297" "I'm surrounded by villainy!  Gotta go!"

// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_NEWSPAPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P326619799" "See?  Another example of lawlessness and contempt for the most basic of moral codes."
// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_NEWSPAPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1601413064" "Malcontents.  All of them."
// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_NEWSPAPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1424919623" "Disgusting.  Why do I subject myself to reading this tripe?"
// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_NEWSPAPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1952760115" "Ah!  We've made page 32.  Good."

// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_NEWSPAPER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1922686323" "You're a bad person!"
// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_NEWSPAPER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P219552342" "I've been warned about people like you!"

// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_SITTING_SITTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3862892832" "I just can't see how this can ever end well."
// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_SITTING_SITTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2802521369" "This going horribly wrong.  No one cares about the plight of a few mis-treated dock workers."
// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_SITTING_SITTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3183953614" "Quiet.  I'm on a break."

// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_SITTING_SITTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1653616887" "Guess break time's over."
// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_SITTING_SITTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3877765122" "See?  Did I not tell you?"

// STM_ALLHOODS_LONE_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4027138443" "Equal work for equal pay!"
// STM_ALLHOODS_LONE_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3115510188" "The Family mistreats us!"
// STM_ALLHOODS_LONE_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2469558823" "Down with poor labor practices!"

// STM_ALLHOODS_LONE_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3967399481" "You're not gonna take me down!"
// STM_ALLHOODS_LONE_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1416985731" "I'm not going down without a fight!  Power to the people!"
// STM_ALLHOODS_LONE_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3570663694" "Corruptor!"

// STM_ALLHOODS_SMALLPICKET_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3399411470" "Dockworkers unite!"
// STM_ALLHOODS_SMALLPICKET_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1064576344" "Dockworkers will not be ignored!"

// STM_ALLHOODS_SMALLPICKET_ALERT_TEXT :
"P589227101" "You can't stop us!"
// STM_ALLHOODS_SMALLPICKET_ALERT_TEXT :
"P975726937" "You should be ashamed!"

// STM_ALLHOODS_SHOVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P464075907" "You think you can take our jobs and we just sit by and let you do it?  Think again!"
// STM_ALLHOODS_SHOVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4128283398" "You're not gonna get away with coming here and taking our jobs!"
// STM_ALLHOODS_SHOVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P118738597" "Bad idea trying to come in and take our jobs, you know!"

// STM_ALLHOODS_SHOVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2743378751" "We got bigger problems!"
// STM_ALLHOODS_SHOVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P36525572" "You're evil!"

// STM_ALLHOODS_SHOVE_NPCVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2532888574" "Hey, man, I didn't do nothing.  The job was there, I took it."
// STM_ALLHOODS_SHOVE_NPCVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1664237109" "You don't own dock working.  I can work here if I want!"
// STM_ALLHOODS_SHOVE_NPCVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2660037010" "What are you talking about!"

// STM_WANDER_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P115980911" "I do not trust ANYONE here.  Miscreants and malcontents.  All of them.  No respect for anything decent."
// STM_WANDER_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1080294238" "If I see anything, I'm going to hit it with a picket sign."
// STM_WANDER_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1449703954" "I hate this place.  St. Martial is a haven for moral slackers."

// STM_WANDER_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P10067778" "You don't care about the common working man!"
// STM_WANDER_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1257956797" "If you're not part of the solution, you're part of the problem!"

// STM_REPLACEMENTFAMILY_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4045704445" "This strike is killing our take on the casino restaurants.  No shrimp cocktail, no gambling."
// STM_REPLACEMENTFAMILY_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1913285423" "Dang workers! Who's been putting poison in their ears about a union?"
// STM_REPLACEMENTFAMILY_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P906662523" "Miserable times this.  We should just squash this little strike quick."
// STM_REPLACEMENTFAMILY_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3157735718" "I've always hated having to come down here to the docks to deal with these uppity workers."
// STM_REPLACEMENTFAMILY_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_A_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4085106340" "Boss says we need to take care of our interests down here.  That means hittin' somebody real hard."

// STM_REPLACEMENTFAMILY_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_A_ALERT_TEXT :
"P632236903" "Go man, go!"
// STM_REPLACEMENTFAMILY_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_A_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2529169835" "Move it.  We got trouble."
// STM_REPLACEMENTFAMILY_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_A_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1316243916" "You made a big mistake in messin' with our interests here."

// STM_REPLACEMENTFAMILY_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CELLPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2832318968" "Yes, Boss. We're dealing with strikers as we come across them."
// STM_REPLACEMENTFAMILY_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CELLPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2641383681" "...Yeah.  Big trouble with the dockworkers.  Looks like the work of outside agitators.  Found a bunch of pamphlets from Paragon City."
// STM_REPLACEMENTFAMILY_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CELLPHONE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3423158695" "Yeah, yeah.  We busted a few of these fools over the head.  Hit 'em with their own picket signs."


// STM_REPLACEMENTFAMILY_ALLHOODS_LOITER_NEWSPAPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1028608764" "No coverage of this little strike in the paper, yet.  Good."
// STM_REPLACEMENTFAMILY_ALLHOODS_LOITER_NEWSPAPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1449214061" "That nosy newspaper reporter was here the other day, asking them union agitators a few questions."
// STM_REPLACEMENTFAMILY_ALLHOODS_LOITER_NEWSPAPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1516996113" "We keep the scuffles with these union fellas on the quiet, maybe we don't show up in the paper."
// STM_REPLACEMENTFAMILY_ALLHOODS_LOITER_NEWSPAPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4026773901" "The Boss sez we should, you know, read the paper sometime. Learn something about the world and all."

// STM_REPLACEMENTFAMILY_ALLHOODS_LOITER_NEWSPAPER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1839302486" "Heads up.  Looks like trouble."
// STM_REPLACEMENTFAMILY_ALLHOODS_LOITER_NEWSPAPER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2120690594" "Get 'em boys!"
// STM_REPLACEMENTFAMILY_ALLHOODS_LOITER_NEWSPAPER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P137396699" "Bust some heads!"

// STM_REPLACEMENTFAMILY_ALLHOODS_LOITER_SITTING_SITTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P162433090" "I'm so tired of carrying these crates myself.  We need to bust this strike fast."
// STM_REPLACEMENTFAMILY_ALLHOODS_LOITER_SITTING_SITTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3135982367" "The Boss had better break up this strike soon.  My back is killing me."
// STM_REPLACEMENTFAMILY_ALLHOODS_LOITER_SITTING_SITTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4050513269" "Lousy ingrates!  One of them threw a rock at me!"
// STM_REPLACEMENTFAMILY_ALLHOODS_LOITER_SITTING_SITTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3853586796" "I'm not sure what their demands are, but we should have none of it."
// STM_REPLACEMENTFAMILY_ALLHOODS_LOITER_SITTING_SITTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P73006319" "These dang Dockworkers.  Can't believe we let them unionize... Outside of our control, that is."


